{"identidad_confirmada": true, "pruebas_identidad": [{"url":"https://obsceneextreme.cz/en/bands/detail/id/mortuus-neurons","cita":"The band is formed with the name of Vomitu Visceral Festum in 2011 in the city of Bogota colombia being the founder Javier Melo; With the alignment that was not hard for more than a month and dissolved. In 2013 the name is changed to Mortuus Neurons"},{"url":"https://www.spirit-of-metal.com/en/band/Mortuus_Neurons","cita":"Mortuus Neurons ... Style Grind Death Status Active Formed In 2013 Country Colombia City Bogota"},{"url":"https://metalcolombiano.com.co/mortuus-neurons/","cita":"Mortuus Neurons es una banda colombiana de Goregrind, originaria de Bogota, formada en 2013."}], "pais": {"valor":"Colombia","url":"https://metalcolombiano.com.co/mortuus-neurons/","cita":"Mortuus Neurons es una banda colombiana de Goregrind, originaria de Bogota, formada en 2013."}, "ciudad": {"valor":"Bogotá","url":"https://obsceneextreme.cz/en/bands/detail/id/mortuus-neurons","cita":"The band is formed with the name of Vomitu Visceral Festum in 2011 in the city of Bogota colombia being the founder Javier Melo"}, "año_formacion": {"valor":2013,"url":"https://metalcolombiano.com.co/mortuus-neurons/","cita":"Mortuus Neurons es una banda colombiana de Goregrind, originaria de Bogota, formada en 2013."}, "generos": [{"genero":"Goregrind","url":"https://metalcolombiano.com.co/mortuus-neurons/","cita":"Mortuus Neurons es una banda colombiana de Goregrind, originaria de Bogota, formada en 2013."},{"genero":"Grind Death","url":"https://www.spirit-of-metal.com/en/band/Mortuus_Neurons","cita":"Style Grind Death Status Active Formed In 2013 Country Colombia City Bogota"}], "datos_para_biografia": [{"dato":"Fundada en 2011 como Vomitu Visceral Festum por Javier Melo; el nombre Mortuus Neurons se adopta en 2013 con Carlos Santos.","url":"https://obsceneextreme.cz/en/bands/detail/id/mortuus-neurons","cita":"The band is formed with the name of Vomitu Visceral Festum in 2011 in the city of Bogota colombia being the founder Javier Melo; With the alignment that was not hard for more than a month and dissolved. In 2013 the name is changed to Mortuus Neurons and formed with Carlos Santos"},{"dato":"Alineación con seudónimos: Necroratory Grinder (voz/guitarra), Creepy Bite (bajo/coros), Zombierrhage (batería).","url":"https://www.spirit-of-metal.com/en/band/Mortuus_Neurons","cita":"Creepy Bite Bass, Back Vocals | Zombierrhage Drums, Percussions, Programming | Necroratory Grinder Vocals, Guitar"},{"dato":"En 2017 publicó su primer álbum de larga duración, Nice to Eat and Gut.","url":"https://obsceneextreme.cz/en/bands/detail/id/mortuus-neurons","cita":"In 2017 thanks to Toilet Records ... will be the first album of the long-lasting band and with a goregrind sound with a lot of power .. the album called Nice to Eat and Gut"}]}
